        <description>v2 budget rework §4c / D15. COST side of the Conduit in Attic adder (budget), as opposed to the PRICE side (commission) per D6. PER-WATT cost: the calc multiplies this by system watts when the adder is selected. Type cloned from this object's per-watt Adder_*_Price__c fields (Number, 3 dp). The calc ALWAYS reads this field and never derives a value, so it must not be left blank. Default 0.052 = (0.1 − 0.02 × 1.75) ÷ 1.25. Price and cost are INDEPENDENT stored values: changing this adder's PRICE does not automatically move its COST. If a job needs both changed, change both.</description>
        <externalId>false</externalId>
        <inlineHelpText>Cost PER WATT for this adder (× system watts). Defaults to 0.052; edit only when this job's cost differs. Changing the adder's price does not change this.</inlineHelpText>
